@startuml
title Cart Service - Add Product And View Cart
actor User
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "CartViewSet" as CartAPI
participant "Product Service" as Product
database "Cart DB" as CartDB
participant "Interaction Service" as Interaction

== Add product ==
User -> Gateway: POST /api/cart/add_product
Gateway -> CartAPI: add_product(product_id, quantity, X-Cart-Session-Key?)
CartAPI -> CartAPI: get_or_create session_key
CartAPI -> Product: GET /api/products/{product_id}
Product --> CartAPI: product detail, stock, price
alt product active and has stock
  CartAPI -> CartDB: create/update Cart item
  CartDB --> CartAPI: cart item
  CartAPI -> CartDB: create CartEvent
  CartAPI -> Interaction: POST cart_item_added
  Interaction --> CartAPI: 201 event
  CartAPI --> Gateway: cart item + X-Cart-Session-Key
  Gateway --> User: cart item
else unavailable product
  CartAPI --> Gateway: 400/404 error
  Gateway --> User: error
end

== Current cart ==
User -> Gateway: GET /api/cart/current
Gateway -> CartAPI: current(X-Cart-Session-Key)
CartAPI -> CartDB: Load Cart items
CartDB --> CartAPI: items
CartAPI -> CartDB: create CartSnapshot + CartEvent
CartAPI -> Interaction: POST cart_viewed
Interaction --> CartAPI: 201 event
CartAPI --> Gateway: cart summary
Gateway --> User: cart summary
@enduml

